     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I tried this with a current master build, and wasn't able to reproduce the problems.  I was able to run this sequence of SPARQL Update commands to successfully insert a property attached to a hash resource, insert a second property on the same resource, remove the first property, add then do a delete/insert combo.",
