  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "There is an undocumented feature in fedora 4 allowing a user to create child nodes on a resource using a #hashvalue. For instance:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -XPOST localhost:8080/rest -H\"Slug: mynode\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "One can create nested metadata on that node like so:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "INSERT {",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<> dc:creator <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> .",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> a foaf:Person ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "foaf:name \"Haruki Murakami\" .",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "} WHERE {}",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The #creator triples are stored as a child node, so when ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " is requested, those triples will be included.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This seems like a useful way of handling nested RDF metadata.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "However, it does not seem possible to add, remove or otherwise modify this child container.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A subsequent SPARQL update has no effect:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "INSERT {",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "foaf:homepage <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.harukimurakami.com/"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.harukimurakami.com/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> .",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "} WHERE {}",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Neither does this:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "DELETE { <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> foaf:name ?o }",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "WHERE { <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> foaf:name ?o }",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Or this:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "DELETE { <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> foaf:name \"Haruki Murakami\" }",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "WHERE { <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> foaf:name \"Haruki Murakami\" }",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Or this:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "DELETE WHERE { <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/mynode#creator",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> ?p ?o }",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This behavior is clearly problematic. I wonder whether \"fixing it\" means changing the code to support the sorts of SPARQL update requests listed above, or whether this feature should be removed entirely.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
