  "comment": {
   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "A. Soroka",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>There is some conversation on the mailing lists about what hash references actually mean in the Fedora model, but little agreement. My suspicion is that they will be most useful to people who insist on doing \"XML-style\" RDF metadata instead of true Linked Data, as replacements for blank nodes.</p>",
     "created": "06/May/15 10:45 AM",
     "id": "14221",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11487/comment/14221",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/628068f58d175962c7274ca5ca03993f?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAS-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "A. Soroka",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "06/May/15 10:45 AM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a13a248ef600739455eb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": false,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Former user",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a13a248ef600739455eb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I tried this with a current master build, and wasn't able to reproduce the problems.  I was able to run this sequence of SPARQL Update commands to successfully insert a property attached to a hash resource, insert a second property on the same resource, remove the first property, add then do a delete/insert combo.</p>\n\n<p>insert </p>\n{ &lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/1234&gt; &lt;http://example.org/foo&gt; \"foo\" . &lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/1234#test&gt; &lt;http://example.org/bar&gt; \"bar\" . }\n<p> where {}</p>\n\n<hr />\n\n<p>insert </p>\n{ &lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/1234#test&gt; &lt;http://example.org/baz&gt; \"baz\" }\n<p> where {}</p>\n\n<hr />\n\n<p>delete where </p>\n{ &lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/1234#test&gt; &lt;http://example.org/bar&gt; \"bar\" }\n\n<hr />\n\n<p>delete </p>\n{ &lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/1234#test&gt; &lt;http://example.org/baz&gt; \"baz\" }\n<p>insert </p>\n{ &lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/1234#test&gt; &lt;http://example.org/quux&gt; \"quux\" }\n<p>where  </p>\n{ &lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/1234#test&gt; &lt;http://example.org/baz&gt; \"baz\" }\n\n\n<p>All of this worked as expected for me.  I've created a gist of the script I was using to test here: <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/escowles/6fd91a14ab319a01e5fc\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://gist.github.com/escowles/6fd91a14ab319a01e5fc</a></p>",
     "created": "07/May/15 4:14 PM",
     "id": "14235",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11487/comment/14235",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "6089a13a248ef600739455eb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": false,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png",
