     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a13a248ef600739455eb\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a13a248ef600739455eb\" data-account-id=\"6089a13a248ef600739455eb\" accountid=\"6089a13a248ef600739455eb\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Former user</a> I had been testing these queries with the web interface, and I actually think the issue related to browser caching (probably the etag issue discussed elsewhere). If I issue the queries without a subsequent \"force\" refresh, the changes are not reflected in the interface. When force-refreshing, the changes show up properly. I'm marking this ticket as closed.</p>",
